        faq_label: "FAQ",
        faq_title: "Frequently Asked Questions",
        faq_q1: "How long does it take to set up my digital invitation?",
        faq_a1: "Most invitations are ready to share within 10–15 minutes. Simply choose a template, fill in your event details, and complete payment to publish instantly.",
        faq_q2: "Can I edit my invitation after it has been published?",
        faq_a2: "Yes! You can go to your dashboard and edit your invitation directly. Please note that you cannot change the event date after publishing.",
        faq_q3: "How does the RSVP system track guest responses?",
        faq_a3: "Guests who open your invitation can confirm their attendance and leave a personal message. Every response is recorded and visible in real-time from your dashboard.",
        faq_q4: "Can guests upload photos using the event camera feature?",
        faq_a4: "Yes. Guests can take photos directly through their phone camera or upload existing ones from the invitation page. All photos are collected into a live gallery.",
        faq_q5: "Is there a limit to the number of guests or views?",
        faq_a5: "No limits. Your invitation link and QR code can be shared with as many guests as you like, and there is no cap on views or RSVP responses.",
        faq_q6: "Do I need technical skills to create my invitation?",
        faq_a6: "Not at all. Our Studio is designed to be simple and intuitive. Just fill in your details, upload your photos, and your invitation is ready.",
