        terms_title: "Terms & Conditions",
        terms_intro: "Please read these Terms & Conditions carefully before purchasing or using any service provided by Numinds Design. By completing a purchase or using our platform, you agree to be bound by the following terms. If you do not agree to these terms, please refrain from using our services.",
        terms_s1_title: "1. Nature of Service",
        terms_s1_content: "Numinds Design provides ready-made digital invitation templates. All products are digital only. No physical items will be delivered under any circumstances. Our service is entirely online and accessible via a unique invitation link.",
        terms_s2_title: "2. Template Usage",
        terms_s2_b1: "Templates are pre-designed and sold as-is.",
        terms_s2_b2: "Customers may request text customisation only (names, dates, venue, and event details).",
        terms_s2_b3: "Customers cannot edit designs themselves or access backend files, source code, or assets.",
        terms_s2_b4: "Major layout or structural changes are not included in the standard service.",
        terms_s3_title: "3. Editing Process",
        terms_s3_b1: "After purchase, customers must contact us with full event details to begin editing.",
        terms_s3_b2: "Editing begins only after all required information is received in full.",
        terms_s3_b3: "Minor revisions are included. Excessive or repeated revision requests may incur additional charges at our discretion.",
        terms_s3_b4: "We aim to complete edits within a reasonable timeframe; however, delays due to incomplete client information are not our responsibility.",
        terms_s4_title: "4. Payment Terms",
        terms_s4_b1: "Full payment is required before editing begins.",
        terms_s4_b2: "All payments are final and non-refundable.",
        terms_s4_b3: "We accept payment via the secure checkout provided on our website.",
        terms_s4_b4: "Prices are subject to change without prior notice.",
        terms_s5_title: "5. Intellectual Property",
        terms_s5_b1: "All templates, designs, graphics, animations, code, and related materials remain the exclusive property of Numinds Design.",
        terms_s5_b2: "Reselling, copying, redistributing, or reproducing any part of our designs is strictly prohibited.",
        terms_s5_b3: "Clients are granted a single-use, non-transferable licence for their purchased invitation only.",
        terms_s5_b4: "Any breach of intellectual property rights may result in legal action.",
        terms_s6_title: "6. Event Camera Feature",
        terms_s6_b1: "Invitations may include a guest photo upload (camera) feature.",
        terms_s6_b2: "The client is solely responsible for monitoring and managing uploaded content.",
        terms_s6_b3: "Numinds Design is not liable for any inappropriate, offensive, or unlawful content uploaded by guests.",
        terms_s6_b4: "We reserve the right to remove any content deemed inappropriate without prior notice.",
        terms_s7_title: "7. Limitation of Liability",
        terms_s7_content: "Numinds Design is not responsible for issues arising from third-party platforms, internet service disruptions, device incompatibility, or incorrect information submitted by the client. Our total liability is limited to the amount paid for the specific service in question.",
        terms_s8_title: "8. Amendments to Terms",
        terms_s8_content: "We reserve the right to update, modify, or replace these Terms & Conditions at any time without prior notice. Continued use of our services following any changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms. We encourage clients to review this page periodically.",
        privacy_title: "Privacy Policy",
        privacy_intro: "At Numinds Design, your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website and services. By using our platform, you agree to the practices described in this policy.",
        privacy_s1_title: "1. Information We Collect",
        privacy_s1_content: "When you use Numinds Design's services, we may collect the following information:",
        privacy_s1_b1: "Full name and contact details (email address, phone number).",
        privacy_s1_b2: "Event details provided for customisation (event title, date, venue, names).",
        privacy_s1_b3: "RSVP responses submitted by your guests through the invitation.",
        privacy_s1_b4: "Photos uploaded by guests using the in-invitation camera feature (if enabled).",
        privacy_s1_b5: "Technical data such as browser type, device type, and IP address for analytics purposes.",
        privacy_s2_title: "2. How We Use Your Information",
        privacy_s2_content: "We use the information collected for the following purposes:",
        privacy_s2_b1: "To customise and deliver your digital invitation as requested.",
        privacy_s2_b2: "To manage and display RSVP responses through the invitation platform.",
        privacy_s2_b3: "To provide customer support and respond to enquiries.",
        privacy_s2_b4: "To improve our services, website performance, and user experience.",
        privacy_s2_b5: "To communicate important updates or changes to your order.",
        privacy_s3_title: "3. Guest Data",
        privacy_s3_b1: "RSVP data and guest-submitted content are associated with your invitation and remain accessible to you as the invitation owner.",
        privacy_s3_b2: "We do not sell, trade, lease, or share personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.",
        privacy_s3_b3: "Guest data is used solely to provide the invitation service you have purchased.",
        privacy_s4_title: "4. Data Protection & Security",
        privacy_s4_b1: "We apply reasonable technical and organisational security measures to protect your data.",
        privacy_s4_b2: "However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.",
        privacy_s4_b3: "We retain your data only as long as necessary to deliver the service and for a reasonable period thereafter.",
        privacy_s5_title: "5. Third-Party Services",
        privacy_s5_b1: "Invitations may integrate with or link to third-party platforms such as WhatsApp, Instagram, and Google Maps.",
        privacy_s5_b2: "Payments are processed through secure third-party payment providers (Stripe).",
        privacy_s5_b3: "We are not responsible for the data handling practices of any third-party services.",
        privacy_s5_b4: "Please review the privacy policies of any third-party services you interact with.",
        privacy_s6_title: "6. Cookies",
        privacy_s6_content: "Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve performance, analyse usage patterns, and enhance your browsing experience. You may choose to disable cookies through your browser settings; however, this may affect certain features of the website.",
        privacy_s7_title: "7. Your Rights",
        privacy_s7_content: "You have the right to:",
        privacy_s7_b1: "Request access to the personal data we hold about you.",
        privacy_s7_b2: "Request correction of any inaccurate or incomplete data.",
        privacy_s7_b3: "Request deletion of your personal data, subject to legal and contractual obligations.",
        privacy_s7_b4: "Withdraw consent for data processing where consent is the legal basis.",
        privacy_s8_title: "8. Changes to This Policy",
        privacy_s8_content: "We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated date. Continued use of our services following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.",
        refund_title: "Refund Policy",
        refund_banner_title: "Strict No Refund Policy",
